{
  "type": "ai-phone-story-scheme",
  "version": 1,
  "kind": "theater",
  "schemes": [
    {
      "name": "片尾彩蛋",
      "prompt": "在正文末尾输出 <story_theater>，写一段不影响主线的短小片尾彩蛋；默认仅展示，不进入下一轮上下文。",
      "renderHtml": "<style>\n:root{--paper:#fffdf8;--text:#4b5563;--sub:#9a8f80;--line:#eadfce}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--paper:#24211d;--text:#e7e1d8;--sub:#a89f94;--line:#4a433a}}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:transparent;color:var(--text);font:13px/1.8 Georgia,\"Songti SC\",serif}\n.theater{position:relative;padding:16px 17px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--paper)}\n.title{margin-bottom:7px;color:var(--sub);font:10px/1.2 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.22em}.text{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n</style>\n<section class=\"theater\"><div class=\"title\">小剧场</div><div id=\"text\" class=\"text\"></div></section>\n<script>document.getElementById('text').textContent=window.STORY_RAW||''</script>",
      "preview": "片尾彩蛋｜如果那一刻被拍成照片，大概会被珍藏很久。"
    },
    {
      "name": "奶黄毛茸茸小剧场",
      "prompt": "请在正文与状态栏之后，输出一段生动趣味的番外加演小剧场，必须严格包裹在 <story_theater> 和 </story_theater> 标签中。\n\n小剧场要求：\n1. 风格轻松、治愈、可爱或暗戳戳反差萌，重点围绕 Char 的“动物塑（如金毛/猫猫/兔子等）”或“脑内剧场与现实反差”展开一段加演。\n2. 篇幅在 150~300 字左右，不影响主线剧情推进。\n3. 第一行写一个小标题（如：【小剧场：金毛小狗的秘密夜袭日记】），后续为生动有趣的段落。\n\n格式示例：\n<story_theater>\n【小剧场：剧场标题】\n加演短文正文内容……\n</story_theater>",
      "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  :root {\n    --bg-theater: #FFFBF0;\n    --border-theater: #F3DCAC;\n    --primary-yellow: #F6C445;\n    --warm-caramel: #8C5B23;\n    --text-main: #5C3D1E;\n    --text-muted: #8E7356;\n    --accent-glow: rgba(246, 196, 69, 0.25);\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :root {\n      --bg-theater: #2E271D;\n      --border-theater: #5C4B33;\n      --primary-yellow: #E6B53A;\n      --warm-caramel: #F5D399;\n      --text-main: #F5EEE6;\n      --text-muted: #C7B5A0;\n      --accent-glow: rgba(230, 181, 58, 0.15);\n    }\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    background: transparent;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n  }\n  .theater-card {\n    background: var(--bg-theater);\n    border: 2px dashed var(--border-theater);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px var(--accent-glow);\n  }\n  /* 拍立得/电影胶卷风格顶标 */\n  .theater-badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    background: var(--primary-yellow);\n    color: #4A2E00;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(246, 196, 69, 0.35);\n  }\n  .theater-title {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--warm-caramel);\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .theater-content {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    white-space: pre-wrap;\n    word-break: break-word;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-theater);\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    .theater-content {\n      background: rgba(40, 33, 23, 0.65);\n    }\n  }\n  .theater-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"theater-card\">\n  <div class=\"theater-badge\">🎬 MINI THEATER · 番外加演</div>\n  <div class=\"theater-title\" id=\"t-title\">🐾 毛茸茸加演短剧</div>\n  <div class=\"theater-content\" id=\"t-content\">正在加载小剧场内容...</div>\n  <div class=\"theater-footer\">\n    <span>💛 本剧场仅供娱乐展示 · 不计入下一轮主线记忆</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  const raw = window.THEATER_RAW || window.STORY_RAW || `{{RAW}}` || '';\n  if (!raw.trim()) return;\n\n  const lines = raw.trim().split(/\\r?\\n/);\n  let title = '🐾 毛茸茸加演短剧';\n  let bodyLines = [];\n\n  if (lines.length > 0 && lines[0].startsWith('【') && lines[0].includes('】')) {\n    title = lines[0].trim();\n    bodyLines = lines.slice(1);\n  } else {\n    bodyLines = lines;\n  }\n\n  const contentText = bodyLines.join('\\n').trim();\n  \n  document.getElementById('t-title').textContent = title;\n  document.getElementById('t-content').textContent = contentText || raw;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "preview": "【小剧场：脑内动物塑大暴走】\n（现实里明明是一脸淡定正经地帮你递温水，脑内却是一只巨大金毛犬在毛茸茸地打滚呜咽）\n🐶 金毛临风把大脑袋使劲拱进你的怀里，两只毛茸茸的垂耳抖了抖，大尾巴在身后疯狂扫来扫去，甚至快要起飞。\n「汪呜……（翻译：就摸一下！就给摸一下好不好，今天一天都没被揉揉脑袋了，小狗要枯萎了！）」\n他在小本本上暗搓搓划掉一条：【计划1：维持成熟稳重人设立体度（宣告彻底失败）】。"
    },
    {
      "name": "水色如果小剧场",
      "prompt": "请在正文与状态栏之后，输出一段生动幽默、脑洞大开的平行走向小加演，必须严格包裹在 <story_theater> 和 </story_theater> 标签中。\n\n小剧场要求：\n1. 主题为【如果……？】——脑洞展开“如果刚才的事情走向了另一个搞笑/反差/失控/直球的方向会怎么样？”\n2. 风格幽默有趣、反差萌爆棚，字数在 150~300 字左右。\n3. 默认仅作为番外加演展示，不影响下一轮主线剧情。\n4. 第一行用【如果……？】作为标题。\n\n格式示例：\n<story_theater>\n【如果……刚才他说了真心话？】\n加演短文正文内容……\n</story_theater>",
      "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  :root {\n    --aqua-bg: #F0F8FF;\n    --aqua-card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n    --aqua-card-inner: rgba(240, 248, 255, 0.9);\n    --aqua-primary: #38A3D8;\n    --aqua-primary-dark: #1E6B9B;\n    --aqua-deep: #164666;\n    --aqua-border: rgba(142, 202, 230, 0.5);\n    --aqua-glow: rgba(56, 163, 216, 0.2);\n    --text-title: #103B59;\n    --text-main: #244C66;\n    --text-muted: #5B829E;\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :root {\n      --aqua-bg: #111E28;\n      --aqua-card: rgba(22, 38, 51, 0.85);\n      --aqua-card-inner: rgba(28, 48, 64, 0.9);\n      --aqua-primary: #52BCE8;\n      --aqua-primary-dark: #82D1F5;\n      --aqua-deep: #BBE1F5;\n      --aqua-border: rgba(82, 188, 232, 0.35);\n      --aqua-glow: rgba(82, 188, 232, 0.15);\n      --text-title: #E1F3FD;\n      --text-main: #CBE6F6;\n      --text-muted: #8AAEC4;\n    }\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    background: transparent;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n  }\n  .theater-card {\n    background: var(--aqua-card);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--aqua-border);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px var(--aqua-glow), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .theater-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .theater-tag {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--aqua-primary), #60C5F8);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--aqua-glow);\n  }\n  .svg-icon {\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    fill: currentColor;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .theater-title {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--text-title);\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .theater-body {\n    background: var(--aqua-card-inner);\n    border: 1px solid var(--aqua-border);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    white-space: pre-wrap;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n  .theater-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"theater-card\">\n  <div class=\"theater-header\">\n    <div class=\"theater-tag\">\n      <svg class=\"svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z\"/></svg>\n      PARALLEL · 如果平行线\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"theater-title\" id=\"t-title\">🌊 如果……？</div>\n  <div class=\"theater-body\" id=\"t-content\">正在载入平行脑洞...</div>\n  <div class=\"theater-footer\">\n    <svg class=\"svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px;\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z\"/></svg>\n    <span>平行加演脑洞 · 仅供娱乐不计入主线记忆</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  const raw = window.THEATER_RAW || window.STORY_RAW || `{{RAW}}` || '';\n  if (!raw.trim()) return;\n\n  const lines = raw.trim().split(/\\r?\\n/);\n  let title = '🌊 如果……？';\n  let bodyLines = [];\n\n  if (lines.length > 0 && lines[0].startsWith('【') && lines[0].includes('】')) {\n    title = lines[0].trim();\n    bodyLines = lines.slice(1);\n  } else {\n    bodyLines = lines;\n  }\n\n  const contentText = bodyLines.join('\\n').trim();\n  \n  document.getElementById('t-title').textContent = title;\n  document.getElementById('t-content').textContent = contentText || raw;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "preview": "【如果……刚才他没有克制住？】\n如果刚才递水的时候手滑泼了你一身——\n他本该冷静地道歉拿毛巾，结果脑子一抽直接把你整个人横抱到了料理台上，耳尖通红地盯着你湿透的衣领结巴：「别……别动，我帮、帮你烘干（物理靠体温）。」\n最后被你用看笨蛋的眼神盯了三秒，堂堂高冷男神瞬间破功，默默蹲在地上把脸埋进膝盖里装死：「对不起，你当我刚才CPU烧了吧……」"
    },
    {
      "name": "追更书评区",
      "prompt": "在剧情正文之后，严格使用 <story_theater> 与 </story_theater> 标签包裹一段【本章追更书评区】小剧场。\n请将本段剧情视为一本热门连载小说最新更新的章节，模拟 4~8 条真实书友的高赞热评与楼中楼互动。\n\n【内容要求】\n1. 活人感与代入感拉满：网名要生动有趣，包含嗑学家、显微镜侦探、发疯尖叫党、嘴硬吐槽怪、急躁催更党等不同风格。\n2. 紧扣本章剧情点：对 chat 与 user 本轮的互动、台词、眼神小动作、拉扯博弈进行疯狂抠糖、深度分析或搞笑吐槽。\n3. 包含楼中楼回复：部分热评附带 1~2 条书友互动楼中楼，营造热烈追更氛围。\n\n【输出格式模版】\n<story_theater>\n[热评 1]\n用户: 昵称\n属地: 省份/地区（如：广东、浙江、被窝里）\n点赞: 纯数字点赞数\n徽章: 可选（如：榜一粉丝、剧情侦探、催更天王、神评）\n内容: 主评论正文\n回复:\n- 用户: 昵称 | 点赞: 数字 | 内容: 回复内容\n- 用户: 昵称 | 点赞: 数字 | 内容: 回复内容\n\n[热评 2]\n...\n</story_theater>",
      "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }\n  :root {\n    --bg-card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    --bg-sub: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);\n    --text-main: #22252a;\n    --text-sub: #7a828e;\n    --border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n    --primary: #ff4777;\n    --accent: #ff85a2;\n    --badge-bg: #fff0f3;\n    --badge-color: #e63963;\n    --like-color: #8c93a0;\n    --like-active: #ff4777;\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :root {\n      --bg-card: rgba(28, 29, 36, 0.88);\n      --bg-sub: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      --text-main: #f0f2f5;\n      --text-sub: #9299a6;\n      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --primary: #ff5c8a;\n      --accent: #ff94b2;\n      --badge-bg: rgba(255, 71, 119, 0.15);\n      --badge-color: #ff7597;\n      --like-color: #727a87;\n      --like-active: #ff5c8a;\n    }\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    padding: 12px 10px 16px;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .container {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 14px 16px 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,71,119,0.04) 0%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n  .header-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .header-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .header-title .icon {\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .count-tag {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 2px 7px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: var(--badge-bg);\n    color: var(--badge-color);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--text-sub);\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .sort-tab {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--primary);\n  }\n  .comment-list {\n    padding: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .comment-item {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    gap: 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    position: relative;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n  }\n  .comment-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  .avatar {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  }\n  .comment-body {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .user-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .user-info {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .username {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n  }\n  .badge {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background: var(--badge-bg);\n    color: var(--badge-color);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .location {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--text-sub);\n  }\n  .like-btn {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--like-color);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    user-select: none;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .like-btn.liked {\n    color: var(--like-active);\n    transform: scale(1.05);\n  }\n  .like-btn svg {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    fill: currentColor;\n  }\n  .comment-text {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    word-break: break-word;\n    margin: 4px 0 8px;\n  }\n  .reply-box {\n    background: var(--bg-sub);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .reply-item {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n  .reply-user {\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n  }\n  .reply-text {\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    opacity: 0.92;\n  }\n  .reply-like {\n    float: right;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--text-sub);\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 2px;\n  }\n  .footer-bar {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: var(--text-sub);\n    background: var(--bg-sub);\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\" id=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <div class=\"header-title\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">📖</span> 本章追更书评区\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"count-tag\" id=\"commentCountTag\">热评</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <span class=\"sort-tab\">按热度</span>\n      <span>最新</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comment-list\" id=\"commentList\"></div>\n  <div class=\"footer-bar\">\n    💬 到底啦 · 参与讨论请在下一章续写投喂\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function getAvatarColor(name) {\n    var colors = [\n      ['#ff758c', '#ff7eb3'],\n      ['#4facfe', '#00f2fe'],\n      ['#43e97b', '#38f9d7'],\n      ['#fa709a', '#fee140'],\n      ['#667eea', '#764ba2'],\n      ['#ff9a9e', '#fecfef'],\n      ['#f6d365', '#fda085'],\n      ['#89f7fe', '#66a6ff']\n    ];\n    var hash = 0;\n    for (var i = 0; i < name.length; i++) {\n      hash = name.charCodeAt(i) + ((hash << 5) - hash);\n    }\n    var pair = colors[Math.abs(hash) % colors.length];\n    return 'linear-gradient(135deg, ' + pair[0] + ', ' + pair[1] + ')';\n  }\n\n  function parseTheater(raw) {\n    if (!raw) return [];\n    var cleaned = raw.replace(/<\\/?story_theater>/gi, '').trim();\n    var blocks = cleaned.split(/\\[(?:热评|楼层|评论|L)?\\s*\\d*\\]/i).filter(function(b) { return b.trim(); });\n    \n    // 如果没有分块标签，按空行或者整段尝试解析\n    if (blocks.length === 0 && cleaned) {\n      blocks = [cleaned];\n    }\n\n    var list = [];\n    blocks.forEach(function(b) {\n      var lines = b.split('\\n').map(function(l) { return l.trim(); }).filter(function(l) { return l; });\n      var item = {\n        user: '匿名书友',\n        location: '',\n        likes: Math.floor(Math.random() * 800) + 120,\n        badge: '',\n        content: '',\n        replies: []\n      };\n\n      var isReplySection = false;\n\n      lines.forEach(function(line) {\n        if (/^回复\\s*[:：]?/i.test(line)) {\n          isReplySection = true;\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (isReplySection || line.startsWith('-') || line.startsWith('·')) {\n          var repLine = line.replace(/^[-·*]\\s*/, '');\n          var repUser = '书友';\n          var repLikes = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100) + 10;\n          var repContent = repLine;\n\n          if (repLine.indexOf('|') !== -1) {\n            var parts = repLine.split('|');\n            parts.forEach(function(p) {\n              var seg = p.trim();\n              if (/^用户\\s*[:：]/i.test(seg)) repUser = seg.replace(/^用户\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n              else if (/^点赞\\s*[:：]/i.test(seg)) repLikes = seg.replace(/^点赞\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n              else if (/^内容\\s*[:：]/i.test(seg)) repContent = seg.replace(/^内容\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n              else if (!repUser || repUser === '书友') repUser = seg;\n              else repContent = seg;\n            });\n          } else {\n            var m = repLine.match(/^([^:：]+)[:：]\\s*(.*)$/);\n            if (m) {\n              repUser = m[1].replace(/^用户\\s*/i, '').trim();\n              repContent = m[2].trim();\n            }\n          }\n          item.replies.push({ user: repUser, likes: repLikes, content: repContent });\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (/^用户\\s*[:：]/i.test(line)) {\n          item.user = line.replace(/^用户\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n        } else if (/^属地\\s*[:：]/i.test(line) || /^IP\\s*[:：]/i.test(line)) {\n          item.location = line.replace(/^(?:属地|IP)\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n        } else if (/^点赞\\s*[:：]/i.test(line) || /^赞\\s*[:：]/i.test(line)) {\n          item.likes = line.replace(/^(?:点赞|赞)\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n        } else if (/^徽章\\s*[:：]/i.test(line) || /^头衔\\s*[:：]/i.test(line)) {\n          item.badge = line.replace(/^(?:徽章|头衔)\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n        } else if (/^内容\\s*[:：]/i.test(line)) {\n          item.content = line.replace(/^内容\\s*[:：]\\s*/i, '');\n        } else if (!item.content) {\n          item.content = line;\n        } else {\n          item.content += ' ' + line;\n        }\n      });\n\n      if (item.content || item.user !== '匿名书友') {\n        list.push(item);\n      }\n    });\n\n    return list;\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    var raw = window.THEATER_RAW || window.STORY_RAW || '';\n    if (!raw) {\n      var templateEl = document.getElementById('raw-preview-data');\n      if (templateEl) raw = templateEl.textContent;\n    }\n    var list = parseTheater(raw);\n    var container = document.getElementById('commentList');\n    var countTag = document.getElementById('commentCountTag');\n\n    if (list.length > 0) {\n      countTag.textContent = list.length + '条讨论';\n    }\n\n    if (list.length === 0) {\n      container.innerHTML = '<div style=\"padding:30px 16px; text-align:center; color:var(--text-sub); font-size:13px;\">暂无书评，精彩内容稍后送达~</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var html = '';\n    list.forEach(function(item, idx) {\n      var initial = (item.user || '匿').charAt(0);\n      var grad = getAvatarColor(item.user || '书友');\n      var badgeHtml = item.badge ? '<span class=\"badge\">' + item.badge + '</span>' : '';\n      var locHtml = item.location ? '<span class=\"location\">IP·' + item.location + '</span>' : '';\n\n      var replyHtml = '';\n      if (item.replies && item.replies.length > 0) {\n        replyHtml += '<div class=\"reply-box\">';\n        item.replies.forEach(function(r) {\n          replyHtml += '<div class=\"reply-item\">';\n          replyHtml += '<span class=\"reply-user\">' + r.user + '：</span>';\n          replyHtml += '<span class=\"reply-text\">' + r.content + '</span>';\n          if (r.likes) {\n            replyHtml += '<span class=\"reply-like\">♥ ' + r.likes + '</span>';\n          }\n          replyHtml += '</div>';\n        });\n        replyHtml += '</div>';\n      }\n\n      html += '<div class=\"comment-item\">';\n      html += '  <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:' + grad + '\">' + initial + '</div>';\n      html += '  <div class=\"comment-body\">';\n      html += '    <div class=\"user-meta\">';\n      html += '      <div class=\"user-info\">';\n      html += '        <span class=\"username\">' + item.user + '</span>';\n      html +=          badgeHtml;\n      html +=          locHtml;\n      html += '      </div>';\n      html += '      <div class=\"like-btn\" onclick=\"toggleLike(this, ' + (parseInt(item.likes) || 0) + ')\">';\n      html += '        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z\"/></svg>';\n      html += '        <span>' + item.likes + '</span>';\n      html += '      </div>';\n      html += '    </div>';\n      html += '    <div class=\"comment-text\">' + item.content + '</div>';\n      html +=      replyHtml;\n      html += '  </div>';\n      html += '</div>';\n    });\n\n    container.innerHTML = html;\n  }\n\n  function toggleLike(el, count) {\n    var span = el.querySelector('span');\n    var isLiked = el.classList.toggle('liked');\n    var cur = parseInt(span.textContent) || count || 0;\n    span.textContent = isLiked ? cur + 1 : Math.max(0, cur - 1);\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('load', render);\n  if (document.readyState === 'complete' || document.readyState === 'interactive') {\n    render();\n  }\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
